            "printed_page": 26
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(As Kannaayiram, having come out, goes toward a pillar—a hand stops him and pulls him back. Kannaayiram is shocked and bewildered—it is Vingan’s hand... Vingan gestures for Kannaayiram to remain silent and hides with him behind the pillar."
      }
    },
